{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>See.</b> The sense is: see this sign that HaShem will give you, that it may be clear to you, that He commanded you to keep Shabbat as He rested on the work of creation; therefore He gives that the manna will come down today double its daily amount." "<b>Stay, each man under it.</b> In his tent." "And the meaning of \"let no man go out from his place\" is to gather the manna, as some men did who went out to gather."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:11.798275476Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}